      "hints": [
        "Take half of the coefficient of $x$ (which is $3$) and form $(x+3)^2$.",
        "Subtract $3^2 = 9$ and add $2$."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Complete the square for the quadratic expression $x^2 + 6x + 2$:\n$$x^2 + 6x + 2 = (x + 3)^2 - 3^2 + 2$$",
        "Simplify the constant terms to obtain the completed square form:\n$$(x + 3)^2 - 9 + 2 = (x + 3)^2 - 7$$"
      ],
